examples DelveTalk 1
case visitors tend the moth lantern
law maker visitor
observe main
  title: Moth lantern
  prose: A lantern waits for its first moth. Light it?
  offer light -> light: Light the lantern
expect view
as visitor
send light
expect result: A small sun for lost moths.
observe main
  title: Moth lantern
  prose: Moths circle the little sun. Let it sleep?
  offer douse -> douse: Let it sleep
expect view
as visitor
send light
expect refusal: source refused: Already lit.
as visitor
at initial
send douse
expect refusal: stale read root
as stranger
send douse
expect refusal: unauthorized
as visitor
send douse
expect result: The moths dream.
